{"speciesId":475,"names":{"fr":"Gallame","es":"Gallade","en":"Gallade","ja":"エルレイド"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"When trying to protect someone, it extends its elbows as if they were swords and fights savagely."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Because it can sense what its foe is thinking, its attacks burst out first, fast, and fierce."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Because it can sense what its foe is thinking, its attacks burst out first, fast, and fierce."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Toujours prêt à protéger son prochain, il se bat férocement avec ses coudes en forme d’épées."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When trying to protect someone, it extends its elbows as if they were swords and fights savagely."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Toujours prêt à protéger son prochain, il se bat férocement avec ses coudes en forme d’épées."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When trying to protect someone, it extends its elbows as if they were swords and fights savagely."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When trying to protect someone, it extends its elbows as if they were swords and fights savagely."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When trying to protect someone, it extends its elbows as if they were swords and fights savagely."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Comme il peut lire les pensées de ses adversaires, il frappe toujours en premier."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Puede presentir los movimientos de sus rivales y por eso ataca siempre antes que ellos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Because it can sense what its foe is thinking, its attacks burst out first, fast, and fierce."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"相手の 考えを 敏感に キャッチする 能力を 持つため 先に 攻撃が できるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il frappe avec les grandes lames à ses coudes. Son talent d’escrimeur n’a d’égal que sa courtoisie."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Lucha con las espadas que salen de sus codos. Es un maestro de la cortesía y la esgrima."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"伸び縮みする ヒジの 刀で 戦う。 居合の 名手。 礼儀正しい ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Comme il peut lire les pensées de ses adversaires, il frappe toujours en premier."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Puede presentir los movimientos de sus rivales y por eso ataca siempre antes que ellos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Because it can sense what its foe is thinking, its attacks burst out first, fast, and fierce."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"相手の 考えを 敏感に キャッチする 能力を 持つため 先に 攻撃が できるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il frappe avec les grandes lames à ses coudes. Son talent d’escrimeur n’a d’égal que sa courtoisie."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lucha con las espadas que salen de sus codos. Es un maestro de la cortesía y la esgrima."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"伸び縮みする ヒジの 刀で 戦う。 居合の 名手。 礼儀正しい ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon, que l’on surnomme « l’escrimeur », ne se sert de ses coudes en forme de lames que s’il doit défendre quelque chose."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Este Pokémon es considerado todo un justiciero. Solo utiliza las espadas que le salen de los codos si tiene una causa que defender."},{"langua